# GLM-5.3-Flash a4e3s requant (~109.5 GiB, KLD 0.043) + MTP (2-token probabilistic drafts, 64K draft vocab), 64K f16 ctx, ub 1024.
# Chat 28.5-29.6 tok/s, prompt 229 / 208 @2K / 32K, agentic 10/10, needle 15/15 (2026-10-14, glm/README.md).
# Needs the 120 GiB GTT pool, no GUI, kho=off; ~8-9 GiB stays free, so run it with a MemAvailable watchdog.
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/GLM-5.3-Flash-a4e3s/GLM-5.3-Flash-a4e3s-00001-of-00004.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=glm-5.3-flash
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp efe3626b1 + patches/llama.cpp-glm (Vulkan)
MODEL_ARGS="--jinja -ngl 99 -ub 1024 --load-mode none -c 65536 --parallel 1 -ctxcp 4 --cache-ram 0 --spec-type draft-mtp --spec-draft-n-max 2 --spec-draft-ubatch 128 --spec-draft-sampling probabilistic --spec-draft-vocab /models/GLM-5.3-Flash-a4e3s/glm-dv-65536.bin"
